 style=\"border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:3/4;position:relative;border:2px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3)\"><img alt=\"Auréva Nails - Floral nail art by Che\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"500px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fnail-new.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:-24px;right:-24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A84C 0%, #E8D28A 50%, #C9A84C 100%);border-radius:12px;padding:24px 28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-dark);text-align:center\"><div class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size:42px;color:var(--noir);font-weight:600;line-height:1\">200+</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--noir);font-weight:600;margin-top:6px\">Clients Served</div></div></div><div><div class=\"font-dm inline-block\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px\">✦ The Artist Behind the Nails ✦</div><h2 class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size:clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 58px);font-weight:400;color:var(--ivory);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:24px\">Meet Che —<br/><em style=\"font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-light)\">Nail artist &amp; creator.</em></h2><p class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgba(250,248,245,0.65);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:20px\">Every set that leaves this studio is the result of hours of careful craft, premium products, and a deep passion for making clients feel extraordinary.</p><p class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgba(250,248,245,0.65);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px\">From delicate florals to intricate leopard art to polished chrome — Che brings creative vision and technical precision to every nail, every time.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\"><span class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px\">Premium Gel Products</span><span class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px\">Sterile Tools</span><span class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px\">Zero Nail Damage</span><span class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px\">Fully Custom</span><span class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px\">Private Studio</span></div><a href=\"#booking\" class=\"btn-gold shimmer-hover\">Book with Che ✦</a></div></div></div></section><section style=\"background:var(--ivory-warm);padding:100px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\" style=\"padding:0 32px\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"margin-bottom:56px\"><div class=\"font-dm inline-block\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px\">✦ Client Love ✦</div><h2 class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size:clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);font-weight:400;color:var(--noir);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">What They Say</h2><div class=\"divider-gold\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:24px\"><div class=\"card-luxury\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border-radius:16px\"><div class=\"stars font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px\">★★★★★</div><blockquote class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:24px\">“<!-- -->Che is genuinely the most talented nail artist I&#x27;ve found. My bridal set had everyone asking where I got them done — absolute perfection.<!-- -->”</blockquote><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--noir)\">Priya M.</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light);letter-spacing:0.08em\">Mumbai<!-- --> · <!-- -->Bridal Suite</div></div></div><div class=\"card-luxury\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border-radius:16px\"><div class=\"stars font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px\">★★★★★</div><blockquote class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:24px\">“<!-- -->The leopard print design she created was SO precise — I couldn&#x27;t believe it was hand-painted. Lasted over 3 weeks with zero chips.<!-- -->”</blockquote><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--noir)\">Ananya S.</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light);letter-spacing:0.08em\">Bangalore<!-- --> · <!-- -->Bespoke Nail Art</div></div></div><div class=\"card-luxury\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border-radius:16px\"><div class=\"stars font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px\">★★★★★</div><blockquote class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:24px\">“<!-- -->My gel extensions look and feel completely natural. The BIAB base is revolutionary — my natural nails are actually stronger underneath.<!-- -->”</blockquote><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--noir)\">Riya K.</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light);letter-spacing:0.08em\">Delhi<!-- --> · <!-- -->Gel Extensions</div></div></div><div class=\"card-luxury\" style=\"padding:36px 32px;border-radius:16px\"><div class=\"stars font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px\">★★★★★</div><blockquote class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:24px\">“<!-- -->The floral art she did for my birthday was stunning — soft pink roses with tiny gems. I was obsessed. Already booked my next appointment!<!-- -->”</blockquote><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light);padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--noir)\">Tara N.</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-light);letter-spacing:0.08em\">Pune<!-- --> · <!-- -->Bespoke Nail Art</div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"booking\" style=\"background:var(--ivory);padding:100px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\" style=\"padding:0 32px\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:80px;align-items:start\" class=\"flex flex-col lg:grid\"><div style=\"padding-top:8px\"><div class=\"font-dm inline-block\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:20px\">✦ Private Studio ✦</div><h2 class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size:clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 58px);font-weight:400;color:var(--noir);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:24px\">Book Your<br/><em style=\"font-style:italic;color:var(--gold)\">Appointment</em></h2><p class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px\">All sessions are by appointment only. Fill out the form and Che will confirm your slot within 24 hours via WhatsApp or phone.</p><div class=\"flex gap-4\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid var(--border-mid);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0\">⏱</div><div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dark);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px\">Duration</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300\">45–150 minutes depending on service</div></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid var(--border-mid);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0\">✦</div><div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dark);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px\">Location</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300\">Private studio — address shared on confirmation</div></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid var(--border-mid);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0\">✓</div><div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dark);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px\">Deposit</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300\">50% deposit required to confirm booking</div></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><div style=\"width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--gold-pale);border:1px solid var(--border-mid);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0\">★</div><div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-dark);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px\">Experience</div><div class=\"font-dm\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:300\">3+ years · 200+ happy clients</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:20px;padding:48px 40px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)\"><form><h3 class=\"font-display\" style=\"font-size:30px;color:var(--noir);margin-bottom:32px;let